{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"bob-cli-kf:000041:note_appended:bob-cli-kf:9bc4fd22509d2be858adb63601ad5b7f37f214cd2e75f90ac971bef40cb40107","timestamp":"2026-11-11T20:44:52Z","actor":"bob-cli-kf.land","operation":"note_appended","issue_id":"bob-cli-kf","payload":{"kind":"note_appended","entry":"Lander verification (bob-cli-kf.land): no child bead carried a PROPOSED FOLLOW-UP entry. Lander triage of its own findings: (1) DECLINED new task: subprocess_runner still joins the stdin writer thread without a deadline; it was already unbounded before this epic and only matters if a payload larger than the pipe buffer meets an escaped grandchild holding stdin. Callers send small JSON. (2) DECLINED new task: stale #[cfg_attr(not(test), allow(dead_code))] on bank month.rs planners now used by ensure/ack (canonical_template, now_created_stamp, plan_insert_day, plan_tick_row). These belong to the active bank epic bob-cli-kd, whose kd.4 import phase is still wiring the remaining planners. (3) DECLINED: gcal escape_badge_url leaves non-ASCII line separators (U+2028/U+0085) unencoded. bob's line parsing and CodeMirror split only on CR/LF, so rows stay single-line. (4) RESOLVED in favor of kf.6: kf.6's drop_all return in capture_targets::append_record_targets reverts the 'retain partial results' comment-level choice made by 6e421597 (k3.4.1 land), because the plan's code baseline predated it. The reviewer's drop_all decision rejected even config_fallback, matches the completion provider, and contradicts no doc (docs/records.md's partial-scan rule covers records list/check, not capture-targets). Kept as implemented. (5) Integrated by lander: moved vault_git.rs's test module below is_ignored. The items_after_test_module clippy error from 1a9b6828 (the outside check-ignore fix for kf.3's regression) was failing CI lint and macOS lint on master. just check now passes locally. (6) Remaining epic-caused defects are planned as a lander-authored tale: vault_rewrite per-file stale rollback and hint, clobber recheck refresh, abort-preservation filter, drain grace, tracker splitlines/mode, and bank ensure line vs kf.4 day-end."}}
